# Summary

Plots are allocated to members as listed in the register of this agreement [[cite:obs-e41b1cc37c36797b4b00be9df896f3146f6e027c "Plots are allocated to members as listed in the register of this agreement."]].

Each plot is forty square metres in size [[cite:obs-e41b1cc37c36797b4b00be9df896f3146f6e027c "Plots are allocated to members as listed in the register of this agreement."]].

Each plot has a defined size, which is one unit of allocation as specified in the agreement [[cite:obs-e41b1cc37c36797b4b00be9df896f3146f6e027c "Plots are allocated to members as listed in the register of this agreement."]].
